@startuml seq-poll
title On-the-spot poll

actor Lecturer
actor Student
participant "HTTP API" as API
participant Room as Room

Lecturer -> API : POST /polls\nquestion, options, optional correct option
API -> Room : store poll
Student -> API : GET /polls
API --> Student : question and options\n(correct option omitted)
Student -> API : POST /polls/{id}/answers\noption + seat zone
API -> Room : one answer per student
Lecturer -> API : GET /polls with lecturer token
API --> Lecturer : counts by option and by zone
@enduml
